ref=\"#cite-13\">↩</a> Nell 在《启蒙琼林》里没有进行任何原创思考 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"1964133551311132307\" href=\"#/post/1964133551311132307\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-14\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-14\">↩</a> Nell 不知道也不认同《启蒙琼林》的目标 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"695843928\" href=\"#/post/695843928\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-15\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-15\">↩</a> 《启蒙琼林》是 Nell 余生的一次大型「入职」经历 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"695969718\" href=\"#/post/695969718\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-16\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-16\">↩</a> 《我的世界》 vs. 《启蒙琼林》 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"697825253\" href=\"#/post/697825253\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-17\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-17\">↩</a> 《启蒙琼林》让人回想起自己的深层赋能经历 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"695387327\" href=\"#/post/695387327\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-18\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-18\">↩</a> 赋能环境的重点是创造成长和行动的机会，而不是技能培养 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"591395654\" href=\"#/post/591395654\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"695665750","title":"《启蒙琼林》是一场巨型情景体验","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":6,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"695843928","title":"Nell 不知道也不认同《启蒙琼林》的目标","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":6,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"1964133551311132307","title":"Nell 在《启蒙琼林》里没有进行任何原创思考","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":3,"minutes":3,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"698476935","title":"§赋能环境、游戏和《启蒙琼林》","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":9,"minutes":6,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"1964135740117062283","title":"《启蒙琼林》无法让专家更进一步","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":1,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"15916671283","title":"论意志的慈善","author":"Michael Nielsen","votes":48,"minutes":3,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「赋能环境」· Michael Nielsen"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"1943678101944013683","title":"如果把知识做成游戏，以玩游戏的方式进行